ction and support properties are not expanded into separate proof nodes.","citation_ids":["support_model_source","support_stieltjes_lean_source","support_model_lean_source"],"evidence_ids":["support_source_bindings_20261024","support_graph_semantic_review_pending"],"id":"support.stieltjes_measure","kind":"claim","label":"Stieltjes measure with the correct initial mass","locator":"main.tex:53–63; Support/GapCurvature.lean:96–119","source_id":"support_tex_main","statement":"For every nonnegative, nondecreasing, right-continuous integrable gamma on [0,1), there exists a locally finite Stieltjes measure mu with mu([0,t])=gamma(t). Thus mu({0})=gamma(0) and mu((a,b])=gamma(b)-gamma(a) for 0<=a<b<1. Its relative support is closed. The support argument applies to every measure satisfying this convention.","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/nodes/support.stieltjes_measure","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/nodes/full_support","id":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/edges/%5B%22full_support%22%2C%22support.stieltjes_measure%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/edges/%5B%22full_support%22%2C%22support.stieltjes_measure%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/nodes/support.stieltjes_measure"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/nodes/support.contact","id":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/edges/%5B%22support.contact%22%2C%22support.stieltjes_measure%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b9